[[File:Spade King (Beta 37.0).png|thumb|194x194px|Beta 37.0]]
Spade King was added in '''Beta 36.1''' with the ability to kill all monsters with a cost of 4 or lower and gain +2/+2 for each. The next update, '''Beta 37.0''', changed this to kill all monsters with a BASE cost of 4 or lower, so cards like [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Lesser_Dog Lesser Dog] and especially [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Inflation Inflation] have no impact on Spade King's (in)ability to kill monsters affected by those.
[[File:Spade King (Beta 38.0).png|thumb|194x194px|Beta 38.0]]
Spade King's effect was again changed in the following update, '''Beta 38.0''', but at a larget impact. Now, it will kill monsters with a current HP of <= 2. He was made more consistant in '''Beta 51.0''', gaining +4/+4 base stats (to 6/8, which was equal to 2 kills), but no longer gaining stats from its Magic.

